#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:3
#: d12242a94eb14629a2c925e80809aacd
msgid "表面薄层扫描（Surface Slab Scan）"
msgstr "Surface Slab Scan"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:5
#: 77476667e6354423bda499f1e10da2fe
msgid "**分类：** 表面"
msgstr "**Category:** Surface"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:7
#: eb7119af59184dc2b531aafbfd86449b
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:9
#: 8051f39274cf4629bdd60954dab4a7c2
msgid "从三维周期体相结构按明确的 Miller 晶面列表切出 slab，并扫描法向重复数与单侧真空厚度。它是确定性枚举：相同输入和参数会得到相同顺序的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Cut slabs from a three-dimensionally periodic bulk structure using an explicit list "
"of Miller planes, while scanning the number of repeats along the surface normal and "
"the one-sided vacuum thickness. This is a deterministic enumeration: identical inputs"
" and parameters produce outputs in the same order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:11
#: 59c908066e5c45dca7d6ed5a3c1921a2
msgid ""
"Miller 指数 $(h,k,l)$ 使用**输入晶胞的倒易基矢**解释。若你希望 `(100)`、`(110)`、`(111)` "
"具有常规晶体学含义，请输入对应的常规晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"The Miller index $(h,k,l)$ is interpreted in the **reciprocal basis of the input "
"cell**. If `(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)` should carry their conventional "
"crystallographic meanings, provide the corresponding conventional cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:13
#: 8ccd77b209bd440e99225121e1f4d922
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:15
#: 1549fe03f056476eadc8c8872334b529
msgid "界面中的每一行表示一个晶面。程序先用"
msgstr ""
"Each row in the interface represents one crystallographic plane. The program first "
"uses"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:17
#: 9b8789d98d6446d6bc362a6c35b80856
msgid ""
"\n"
"g=\\gcd(|h|,|k|,|l|),\\qquad (h,k,l)\\rightarrow(h/g,k/g,l/g)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:21
#: a8f29d4f2713492ba1eaed95cead629e
msgid "约简比例相同的指数，再按约简结果去重；例如 `(002)` 会并入 `(001)`，但 `(00-1)` 保留为另一取向。"
msgstr ""
"to reduce proportionally equivalent indices, then removes duplicates based on the "
"reduced result. For example, `(002)` is merged into `(001)`, whereas `(00-1)` is "
"retained as the opposite orientation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:23
#: 708b54e57fe7449b83ba0ad34b98c0d4
msgid ""
"对每个晶面、法向重复数 $r$ 和单侧真空 $v$ 调用 ASE `surface`。若输入有 $N$ 个原子，该组合得到 $Nr$ 个原子。真空会同时加在 slab "
"上下两侧，因此总真空间隔增加 $2v$。"
msgstr ""
"For every plane, normal repeat count $r$, and one-sided vacuum value $v$, the program"
" calls ASE `surface`. An input containing $N$ atoms gives $Nr$ atoms for that "
"combination. Vacuum is added above and below the slab, so the total vacuum separation"
" increases by $2v$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:25
#: 8a56929a4d7b442095a46cd33e9af61a
msgid ""
"输出会重新定向，使表面法向沿笛卡尔 $z$，第一条面内晶格矢量沿 $x$，第二条位于 $xy$ 平面。每组参数只生成一种由输入晶胞原点决定的 "
"termination；若需要比较不同 termination，应准备具有不同原点/切分位置的体相输入。"
msgstr ""
"The output is reoriented so that the surface normal lies along Cartesian $z$, the "
"first in-plane lattice vector lies along $x$, and the second lies in the $xy$ plane. "
"Each parameter combination produces only one termination, determined by the origin of"
" the input cell. To compare different terminations, prepare bulk inputs with "
"different origins or cleavage positions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:27
#: 50e899ab0e544f1c894f631c70ebdaf8
msgid "范围 `[start, stop, step]` 只取不超过 `stop` 的点，点数为"
msgstr ""
"A `[start, stop, step]` range includes only points that do not exceed `stop`; the "
"number of points is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:29
#: fbb57c2796374987907730b56de34d8f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n=1+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{stop-start}{step}\\right\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:33
#: 89f87baf2ae549b6bc84e4cdb25a4db8
msgid "设约简去重后有 $n_h$ 个晶面、$n_r$ 个重复数和 $n_v$ 个真空值，则每个输入精确产生"
msgstr ""
"If reduction and deduplication leave $n_h$ planes, $n_r$ repeat counts, and $n_v$ "
"vacuum values, each input produces exactly"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:35
#: 62b1161a0834407d82031dfa52fedc26
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{out}=n_hn_rn_v,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:39
#: cddb01632b0c4502bcb1e845d4332f66
msgid "总生成原子数为"
msgstr "The total number of generated atoms is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:41
#: f457077b12ca4793b166f1ede0f58f93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{atoms}=N\\,n_hn_v\\sum_r r.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:45
#: 33c7dfda7aa647088a7491dbd9d1d3be
msgid "界面预览和运行前预算校验使用同一套公式，不会为了计数提前构造 slab。"
msgstr ""
"The interface preview and pre-run budget check use the same formulas; slabs are not "
"constructed early merely to count them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:47
#: 814dc24eb82d4cfa9c1a0e613e95b654
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:49
#: 28e951856e234326b5d784450559384f
msgid "场景：模型对低指数表面的力误差明显高于体相"
msgstr "Scenario: force errors on low-index surfaces are much larger than in the bulk"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:51
#: 38f07527a2fa4d60b5c7e286575d80e3
msgid "训练集主要是体相结构，表面低配位环境覆盖不足。"
msgstr ""
"The training set consists mainly of bulk structures and does not adequately cover "
"undercoordinated surface environments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:53
#: f58aa6fc4ad0430a8bada5e71923ee6c
msgid "**输入：** 8 原子的常规 Si 晶胞，三方向均为周期边界。"
msgstr "**Input:** An eight-atom conventional Si cell, periodic in all three directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:55
#: dbeb73ecb5cc43a1b4f24bc9cd9f4992
msgid "**目标：** 覆盖 `(100)`、`(110)`、`(111)`，法向重复数 3–6，单侧真空 10 Å。"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Cover `(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)`, with 3–6 repeats along the normal and "
"10 Å of one-sided vacuum."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:57
#: 780b52c12d5c4733b3cf06f1222493a2
msgid ""
"**参数设置：** "
"`hkl_list=[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`，`layer_range=[3,6,1]`，`vacuum_range=[10,10,1]`。"
msgstr ""
"**Parameters:** `hkl_list=[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`, `layer_range=[3,6,1]`, and "
"`vacuum_range=[10,10,1]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:59
#: 6e8bd29033f7410f837919b6b9722c6a
msgid "**输出：** 每个输入 12 个 slab，单个输出含 24–48 个原子，总计 432 个生成原子。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 12 slabs per input, each containing 24–48 atoms, for 432 generated atoms "
"in total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:61
#: f610c7159cd145f68c7d7609460d6d05
msgid ""
"**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 先检查输出的晶面、cell 和上下真空是否符合预期；标注并重训后，对独立的 `(100)/(110)/(111)` "
"表面验证集分别比较能量和力误差。"
msgstr ""
"**How to verify that training-set quality improved:** First check that the output "
"planes, cells, and vacuum above and below each slab match the intended setup. After "
"labeling and retraining, compare energy and force errors separately on independent "
"`(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)` surface validation sets."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:63
#: 623caf3c282948d1bdf376c412f15116
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:65
#: 686a2ad96887489baabb9e69af705bfd
msgid "晶面列表（hkl_list）"
msgstr "Plane List (hkl_list)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:67
#: 34e7f8b03e9d4855b1cb39d5c7e3cb85
msgid "嵌套整数列表，默认 `[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`。每行直接填写一个 `(h,k,l)`；可用低指数预设起步，再增删行。"
msgstr ""
"Nested integer list, default `[[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[1,1,1]]`. Enter one `(h,k,l)` plane "
"per row. Start from the low-index preset, then add or remove rows as needed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:69
#: 3dfadb90ce244144aaaa69cd0d0919f3
msgid "指数相对输入晶胞的倒易基矢。程序自动约简并去重比例相同的行，`(0,0,0)` 会明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Indices are relative to the reciprocal basis of the input cell. The program "
"automatically reduces and deduplicates proportional rows, and reports `(0,0,0)` as an"
" explicit error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:71
#: 28450c259851484296bac2dda9b2c8ab
msgid "法向等价重复范围（layer_range）"
msgstr "Normal Repeat Range (layer_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:73
#: 8b846785bbcd4d3ea3970fdd92f3070e
msgid ""
"三个整数，默认 `[3,6,1]`，依次为起点、终点、步长。这里的 `r` 是 ASE 将定向后的体相单元沿表面法向重复的次数，因此输出原子数是 "
"$Nr$；它不保证等于肉眼数出的原子平面数。"
msgstr ""
"Three integers, default `[3,6,1]`, giving start, stop, and step. Here, `r` is the "
"number of times ASE repeats the oriented bulk unit along the surface normal, so the "
"output contains $Nr$ atoms. It is not guaranteed to equal the number of atomic planes"
" seen by eye."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:75
#: d7bfdca1cc4648de92123e285b1e4789
msgid "增加 `r` 会让 slab 更厚，也会线性增加单个输出的原子数。可用表面能或中心层局域环境随 `r` 的收敛情况选择范围。"
msgstr ""
"Increasing `r` makes the slab thicker and increases the atom count of each output "
"linearly. Choose the range by checking convergence of the surface energy or the local"
" environment in the central layers with respect to `r`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:77
#: 97115592ba374cd68c3f6a515cf90646
msgid "单侧真空范围（vacuum_range）"
msgstr "One-Sided Vacuum Range (vacuum_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:79
#: 405a8ee9f1f94bdf9febcc8165699027
msgid "三个浮点数，默认 `[10,10,1]`，单位 Å。每个值分别加在 slab 上、下两侧，总真空间隔增加两倍。"
msgstr ""
"Three floating-point values, default `[10,10,1]`, in Å. Each value is added above and"
" below the slab, so the total vacuum separation increases by twice that value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:81
#: df963347775a4617b5882186a2ecc265
msgid "需要放置较高吸附物时可增大真空；是否足够应由体系尺寸和后续计算的真空收敛结果判断。"
msgstr ""
"Increase the vacuum when accommodating tall adsorbates. Whether it is sufficient "
"should be determined from the system dimensions and a vacuum-convergence test for the"
" subsequent calculation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:83
#: d71a33a8f3f94b25850a7908a4834972
msgid "法向周期边界（normal_pbc）"
msgstr "Periodic Boundary along Normal (normal_pbc)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:85
#: 83a09aba28184871a09f928b1c3a6c3e
msgid "布尔值，默认 `true`。开启时输出三个方向均周期；关闭时只有面内周期，表面法向为非周期。"
msgstr ""
"Boolean, default `true`. When enabled, the output is periodic in all three "
"directions. When disabled, only the in-plane directions are periodic and the surface "
"normal is nonperiodic."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:87
#: bc6b040c2dca4cda96d53605dbbb7aef
msgid "关闭时单侧真空必须大于 0，否则法向 cell 无法形成有效尺寸。"
msgstr ""
"When it is disabled, one-sided vacuum must be greater than zero; otherwise the cell "
"cannot acquire a valid size along the normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:89
#: c0954d8aebec4b71ad4eea7ec474d2a5
msgid "每输入最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Outputs per Input (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:91
#: 3b5d388b96724630a1ca17a3d5072c33
msgid "正整数，默认 200。若 $n_hn_rn_v$ 超过该值，运行会在构造第一个 slab 前停止并提示缩小扫描或主动提高上限。"
msgstr ""
"Positive integer, default 200. If $n_hn_rn_v$ exceeds this value, the run stops "
"before constructing the first slab and asks you to narrow the scan or deliberately "
"raise the limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:93
#: 1439ffd6af604d07bd2cc62691218827
msgid "每输入生成原子预算（max_generated_atoms）"
msgstr "Generated-Atom Budget per Input (max_generated_atoms)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:95
#: f47df9f17836463d9df41f7a5081d124
msgid "正整数，默认 200000。它限制所有输出的原子数总和 $Nn_hn_v\\sum_r r$，用于避免一个大输入或宽扫描意外占满内存。"
msgstr ""
"Positive integer, default 200000. It limits the total atom count across all outputs, "
"$Nn_hn_v\\sum_r r$, preventing a large input or broad scan from unexpectedly "
"exhausting memory."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:97
#: b27f3e905c7a40f8946544f143161753
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:99
#: c3acaf816e3540159a09607d77f87f34
msgid "单个 `(111)` 收敛扫描"
msgstr "Single `(111)` Convergence Scan"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:101
#: 6da3d2d7330b48cd86508673c3448004
msgid "用于只比较 slab 厚度是否收敛，共 6 个输出。"
msgstr "Use this to examine slab-thickness convergence alone; it produces six outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:103
#: 041ca51ec0784783836b517c8ac6034f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"hkl_list\": [[1, 1, 1]],\n"
"    \"layer_range\": [3, 8, 1],\n"
"    \"vacuum_range\": [12.0, 12.0, 1.0],\n"
"    \"normal_pbc\": true,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 50,\n"
"    \"max_generated_atoms\": 100000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:118
#: e3d5f72f9e2141278012c6131b431293
msgid "三个低指数面覆盖"
msgstr "Coverage of Three Low-Index Surfaces"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:120
#: 82cbf15f935943828dd7dd558478928f
msgid "用于同时补充 `(100)`、`(110)`、`(111)`，并比较 10 Å 与 15 Å 单侧真空，共 24 个输出。"
msgstr ""
"Use this to add `(100)`, `(110)`, and `(111)` together and compare 10 Å with 15 Å of "
"one-sided vacuum; it produces 24 outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:122
#: 10ed6735de744de89d9e7bfc3811fa4c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"hkl_list\": [[1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 0], [1, 1, 1]],\n"
"    \"layer_range\": [3, 6, 1],\n"
"    \"vacuum_range\": [10.0, 15.0, 5.0],\n"
"    \"normal_pbc\": true,\n"
"    \"max_outputs\": 100,\n"
"    \"max_generated_atoms\": 200000\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:137
#: 804571198e5542db89819a1bb1ef9921
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:139
#: 77095dee7e884093bd0aa3fff8d87980
msgid "`Surface Slab Scan → Insert Defect`：先切出目标晶面，再生成表面吸附候选。"
msgstr ""
"`Surface Slab Scan → Insert Defect`: first cut the target surface, then generate "
"candidate adsorption structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:140
#: 96b6580b58254872babcb3c5d94ed225
msgid "`Surface Slab Scan → Atomic Perturb`：在已确认正确的 slab 上加入小幅热扰动环境。"
msgstr ""
"`Surface Slab Scan → Atomic Perturb`: add small thermal-like perturbations to slabs "
"whose construction has already been verified."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:141
#: 0e623ddc1403433b87212a719a08c5ae
msgid "已有 slab 只需沿当前法向复制时，用 `Layer Stack`；需要从体相按 Miller 面重新定向时用本卡片。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Layer Stack` when an existing slab only needs replication along its current "
"normal. Use this card when a bulk structure must be reoriented and cut by Miller "
"plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:143
#: b735547316184b06a4b492d18a976cfb
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:145
#: ccbf38fc053446e3b6d560f861ae0ddf
msgid "**`(002)` 为什么没有单独输出？** 它与 `(001)` 比例相同，约简后自动去重。相反方向 `(00-1)` 不会合并。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is there no separate output for `(002)`?** It is proportional to `(001)` and is"
" removed after reduction. The opposite orientation `(00-1)` is not merged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:147
#: 1a50158d22ab44dab0b4f9c1b8013fbd
msgid ""
"**重复数为什么不等于看到的原子层数？** 它重复的是 ASE 定向后的体相单元。用输出的实际原子平面与目标性质收敛情况判断 slab 厚度，不要把 `r` "
"当作固定的原子平面计数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the repeat count differ from the visible number of atomic layers?** It "
"repeats the bulk unit after ASE has oriented it. Judge slab thickness from the actual"
" atomic planes in the output and convergence of the target property; do not treat `r`"
" as a fixed count of atomic planes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:149
#: 0048fef494374cf7b84e254a4428bc75
msgid "**为什么运行前就提示超限？** 精确输出数或总生成原子数超过安全参数。预览会给出当前数量；缩小晶面/范围，或在确认资源足够后提高对应上限。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is a limit reported before the run starts?** The exact output count or total "
"generated-atom count exceeds a safety limit. The preview shows the current count. "
"Reduce the plane list or scan ranges, or raise the corresponding limit after "
"confirming that sufficient resources are available."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:151
#: a3fa337713b348b0b5a5dc43c6873795
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:153
#: b77b853ef9d641a486bb257d2d73678e
msgid "`Slab(hkl=(h,k,l),R=重复数,vac=单侧真空,pz=0|1)`。`pz` 表示表面法向是否周期。"
msgstr ""
"`Slab(hkl=(h,k,l),R=repeat count,vac=one-sided vacuum,pz=0|1)`. `pz` indicates "
"whether the surface normal is periodic."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:155
#: 30e0485fe3bf46ca92884f92a9de7447
msgid "旧配置迁移"
msgstr "Legacy Configuration Migration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-slab-card.md:157
#: 61f6fe46cbb2447da9fd03a48c22fa6d
msgid ""
"旧版 `h_range/k_range/l_range` "
"会在加载时按旧范围展开，再约简、去重并显示成晶面表格。界面会给出迁移提示，请在运行前核对可见列表；范围步长不再产生超过终点的额外值。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy `h_range/k_range/l_range` values are expanded using the old ranges when "
"loaded, then reduced, deduplicated, and displayed as a plane table. The interface "
"shows a migration notice; verify the visible list before running. Range stepping no "
"longer produces an extra value beyond the stop value."

