#~ msgid "卡片对 Miller 指数、层数和真空厚度做笛卡尔积扫描："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The card scans the Cartesian product of "
#~ "Miller indices, layer counts, and vacuum "
#~ "thicknesses:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "\\mathcal O=\n"
#~ "\\{(h,k,l,L,v): (h,k,l)\\ne(0,0,0)\\}.\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对每个组合调用周期表面构造，把 $(hkl)$ 平面作为表面法向，沿法向堆叠 $L$ 层； $v>0$"
#~ " 时在法向加入对应 Å 数的真空，$v=0$ 时不额外加真空。输出数的理论上限是各扫描 点数的乘积减去 "
#~ "$(0,0,0)$ 组合。失败的不可构造晶面会记录并跳过，因此实际输出可能更少。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For each combination, it calls periodic "
#~ "surface construction, uses the $(hkl)$ plane "
#~ "as the surface normal, and stacks $L$ "
#~ "layers along that normal. When $v>0$, it "
#~ "adds the corresponding vacuum in Å; when "
#~ "$v=0$, no extra vacuum is added. The "
#~ "theoretical output limit is the product of "
#~ "scan-point counts minus the $(0,0,0)$ "
#~ "combination. Invalid or unconstructable planes are"
#~ " recorded and skipped, so the actual output"
#~ " may be smaller."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在表面吸附能上系统性偏离 DFT"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: model adsorption energies are systematically biased relative to DFT"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在体相 Pt 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，体相弹性和声子都很好。然后跑 Pt(111) "
#~ "表面上的 CO 吸附能——模型预测的吸附能比 DFT 弱 0.5 eV，误差远超可接受范围。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You trained an NEP model on bulk Pt "
#~ "and obtained good elastic and phonon "
#~ "properties. For CO adsorption on Pt(111), "
#~ "however, the predicted adsorption is 0.5 eV"
#~ " weaker than DFT, well outside the "
#~ "acceptable error."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 训练集里全是体相 Pt 结构，模型从来没见过表面的低配位原子。Pt(111) "
#~ "表面的台阶位、平台位的局域环境与体相完全不同——配位数从 12 降到 9 甚至更低。模型需要见过多种表面取向和厚度的"
#~ " slab 才能泛化到表面化学。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** The training set contains only "
#~ "bulk Pt, so the model has never seen "
#~ "undercoordinated surface atoms. Terrace and step "
#~ "environments on Pt(111) differ strongly from "
#~ "bulk coordination, dropping from 12 neighbors "
#~ "to 9 or fewer. Include slabs with "
#~ "multiple orientations and thicknesses before "
#~ "expecting transfer to surface chemistry."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个体相 fcc Pt 单胞"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A bulk fcc Pt unit cell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 切出 (111) 面，3~6 层厚，10 Å 真空，覆盖多种 Miller 指数组合"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** Generate slabs spanning several Miller-"
#~ "index combinations, with 3–6 layers and 10 "
#~ "Å of vacuum, including the (111) surface."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Miller 指数 h 范围`（`h_range`） = `[0, 1, "
#~ "1]`，`Miller 指数 k 范围`（`k_range`） = `[0, 1, "
#~ "1]`，`Miller 指数 l 范围`（`l_range`） = `[1, 3, "
#~ "1]`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Miller index h range` (`h_range`) = `[0, "
#~ "1, 1]`, `Miller index k range` (`k_range`) "
#~ "= `[0, 1, 1]`, `Miller index l range`"
#~ " (`l_range`) = `[1, 3, 1]`"

#~ msgid "`Layer Range` = `[3, 6, 1]`"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`真空层范围`（`vacuum_range`） = `[10, 10, 1]`"
#~ msgstr "`Vacuum-layer range` (`vacuum_range`) = `[10, 10, 1]`"

#~ msgid "**输出：** 多个 slab 结构，覆盖不同 hkl 组合、3~6 层厚度、10 Å 真空，带 `Slab(hkl=...,L=...,vac=...)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Slab structures over the selected "
#~ "*hkl* combinations and 3–6 layer thicknesses "
#~ "with 10 Å vacuum, labeled "
#~ "`Slab(hkl=...,L=...,vac=...)`."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后计算 Pt(111) 上的 CO 吸附能，应该接近 DFT 参考"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After DFT labeling and retraining, recalculate "
#~ "CO adsorption on Pt(111) and compare it "
#~ "with the DFT reference."

#~ msgid "检查 slab 上下表面没有重叠，真空层足够隔离周期镜像"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Check that the two slab surfaces do not"
#~ " overlap and that the vacuum separates "
#~ "periodic images adequately."

#~ msgid "如果表面能预测仍不准，扩大 `Miller 指数 l 范围`（`l_range`）到 `[1, 5, 1]` 覆盖更多高指数面"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If surface-energy predictions remain inaccurate, "
#~ "extend `Miller index l range` (`l_range`) to"
#~ " `[1, 5, 1]` to cover more high-index"
#~ " surfaces."

#~ msgid "如果 slab 太薄表面效应过强，增大 `层数范围`（`layer_range`）的下限"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the slab is too thin and surface "
#~ "effects are too strong, increase the lower "
#~ "bound of `Layer-count range` (`layer_range`)."

